<title>USA: Compass Bancshares sets 3-for-2 shr split.</title>
<headline>Compass Bancshares sets 3-for-2 shr split.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compass Bancshares Inc said on Tuesday its board of directors set a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders would recieve one additional Compass share for each two shares they held as of the March 17 record date, the company said. Shares would be distributed on April 2 after the payment of the quarterly cash dividend, it said.</p>
<p>Cash would be paid in lieu of fractional shares, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
